  },
  {
    "command": "remove_character",
    "id": "left"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "るか",
    "text": "（な、何だろう。カラオケをしてるはずなのに、別の遊びをしてるっぽい感じ？）"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "るか",
    "text": "（というか。さっきから、北川さんがマイクから手を放してくれない）"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "るか",
    "text": "（ぼく、歌の練習にきたんだけどな。さっきから、ずっと北川さんが歌ってるよ）"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "るか",
    "text": "（作詞や、作曲だけじゃなくて……。）"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "るか",
    "text": "（ギターとか歌とかできたら、もっと軽音部に貢献できるようになる）"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 28,
    "dress": "old-default",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-default_expression/joyful",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 22,
      "y": 472
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "るか",
    "text": "（ギターは、まだ難しいけど。歌なら……。すず先輩やしずくちゃんも、褒めてくれたことあるし。）"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "るか",
    "text": "（ぼく、ちょびっと自信あるんだ）"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 28,
    "dress": "old-default",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-default_expression/normal",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 22,
      "y": 472
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "るか",
    "text": "（『できない』ことを『できる』ようにするより、）"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "るか",
    "text": "（『ちょっとできる』ことを『もっとできる』ようにするほうが簡単だもんね）"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 28,
    "dress": "old-default",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-default_expression/sad",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 22,
      "y": 472
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "るか",
    "text": "（部長さんが入院中で、軽音部は深刻なヴォーカル不足だし）"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "るか",
    "text": "（こないだの歌劇のときは、合唱部のひとが手伝ってくれたけど。）"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "るか",
    "text": "（毎回、他の部に助っ人を頼むのも手間だし）"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 28,
    "dress": "old-default",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-default_expression/joyful",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 22,
      "y": 472
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "るか",
    "text": "（ぼくが、歌えるようになれば）"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "るか",
    "text": "（軽音部は、もっともっと活動の幅を広げられる）"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 28,
    "dress": "old-default",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-default_expression/normal",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 22,
      "y": 472
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "るか",
    "text": "（だから部活がお休みのときは、カラオケで練習するのが日課になってて。）"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "るか",
    "text": "（たまたまカラオケの横にあるゲーセンで、北川さんを見かけたから誘ってみて……）"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 28,
    "dress": "old-default",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-default_expression/sad",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 22,
      "y": 472
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "るか",
    "text": "（ぼく、北川さんと仲良くなりたいし。ヒトカラもいいけど、ときどき寂しくなっちゃうから。）"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 28,
    "dress": "old-default",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-default_expression/joyful",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 22,
      "y": 472
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "るか",
    "text": "（聞いてるだけでも、けっこう楽しいし勉強になる気がする～♪）"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "るか",
    "text": "（北川さんが、わりとすんなり付きあってくれてよかった。）"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 28,
    "dress": "old-default",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-default_expression/amazed",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 22,
      "y": 472
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "るか",
    "text": "（ちょっとは、仲良くなれたって思ってもいいのかな……？）"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 28,
    "dress": "old-default",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-default_expression/joyful",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 22,
      "y": 472
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "るか",
    "text": "（えへへ、誰かといっしょにカラオケするのも楽しいな。）"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "るか",
    "text": "（いつか、軽音部のみんなでこれたらいいな。部長さんが退院したら、みんなで……♪）"
